 "strings": {
  "Stabbed her a few times\nand then burned her!?": "",
  "Okubo-kun took the fall for all of it...\nYou sent a good man to die!": "",
  "Okubo-kun took the fall for that,\nand he's still on death row!": "",
  "I never wanted to kill anyone!": "",
  "I didn't kill her because I wanted to!": "",
  "But it had to happen for AD-9.": "",
  "It was for AD-9's sake...": "",
  "It was the only way\nto save all of them!": "",
  "It was so I could save the entire world!": "",
  "The toxin is irremovable.\nUse of AD-9 will always result in death.": "",
  "\"There's no way to remove\nthe toxins from AD-9.\"": "",
  "Shono-kun told me as much.": "",
  "Those were Shono-kun's words.": "",
  "Countless human experiments led him\nto that conclusion. In other words...": "",
  "That was his conclusion after tests\nfailed on a number of human subjects.": "",
  "AD-9's development...": "",
  "In other words, AD-9... ": "",
  "has failed.": "",
  "...Failed.": "",
  "But Shono-kun didn't\nwant to admit that.": "",
  "But he wasn't going\nto tell anyone that.": "",
  "He couldn't say that it was over. That he had killed\nseveral people. That it was all for naught.": "",
  "He couldn't say he'd already killed\nseveral people... All for nothing.": "",
  "And when exactly did\nShono-san tell you all this?": "",
  "And when did you\nfirst learn of this?": "",
  "Only the other day.": "",
  "Just the other day.": "",
  "It was after hearing that...\nthat I decided to testify in this trial.": "",
  "It's what led me to agree\nto testify in this trial.": "",
  "Save the world...\nThat's your bullshit excuse, huh?": "",
  "You did it so you could \"save the world\"?": "",
  "I don't buy it.": "",
  "You're a liar. ": "",
  "The reason you murdered Emi-chan...\nwas so you could save your own skin.": "",
  "You only killed Emi-chan\nso you could save yourself!": "",
  "If you really cared about helping people, you would have left\nyour research to someone else instead of resorting to murder!": "",
  "If saving the world was your goal,\nyou could've passed AD-9 to anyone else.": "",
  "But AD-9 is my drug!\nI'm the only one who could have finished it! ": "",
  "I'm the one who did the research!\nI'm the only one who could complete it!": "",
  "And now I'll finally prove it!": "",
  "So I'll demonstrate that for you now!": "",
  "Prove that all my research was\nworth the effort!": "",
  "I'll prove that my drug is right!": "",
  "Prove that I was right\nto do what I did!": "",
  "I'll prove that everything\nI did was right!": "",
  "For the longest time... my mother cared\nfor both of my dementia-ridden grandparents.": "",
  "My mother cared for my grandparents,\nwho suffered from dementia, for a long time...": "",
  "Once the disease had finally,\nmercifully taken them... my mother died too.": "",
  "And when they died,\nshe collapsed and died too, utterly spent.": "",
  "So you see... Alzheimers has taken\nmany loved ones away, even from me.": "",
  "So much of my own beloved family\nwas lost to Alzheimer's.": "",
  "But now... it won't be taking\nanyone else... ever again.": "",
  "But now I'm putting an end\nto that tragic cycle forever.": "",
  "My entire career as a researcher...\nAll the time I spent developing AD-9...": "",
  "The reason I took up science...\nThe reason I developed this drug...": "",
  "Every single minute of it\nhas led to this moment.": "",
  "...Is because God chose\nthis fate for me.": "",
  "But why!": "",
  "Why!?": "",
  "So that's why...": "",
  "I see...": "",
  "I finally under...stand...": "",
  "So... That's why...": "",
  "When a patient is injected with AD-9,\nthey experience intense pain localized to the head.": "",
  "The side effects of AD-9\nare severe headache... ": "",
  "And their eyes become filled\nwith a dark blue pigment.": "",
  "And blue pigmenting of the eyes.": "",
  "In the end...\nit's a gruesome death.": "",
  "Once that happens,\nthe subject is beyond saving.": "",
  "As for the eyes... The toxins present in AD-9\nare what turns them blue. Shono-kun admitted as much.": "",
  "The blue pigmentation is an effect\nof AD-9's toxic build-up, Shono told me.": "",
  "Had that been noticed... it would have been\nclear proof of the experiments.": "",
  "And it would have been a telltale\nsign of human experimentation.": "",
  "And hence... ": "",
  "As you can surmise...": "",
  "Every single corpse discovered in Kamurocho\nwas found with the eyes removed.": "",
  "That's why all the bodies found\nin Kamurocho... had their eyes removed.": "",
  "Shono-kun disposed of them... ": "",
  "And it was Shono...": "",
  "All in an effort to hide\nthe horrible truth of his failure.": "",
  "...Who disposed of them.": "",
  "I can't thank you enough...": "",
  "Thank you so much.": "",
  "Yagami-sensei.": "",
  "Next week, huh?\nThat's soon.": "",
  "You get out next week?": "",
  "It'll be nice to be out\nafter all these years.": "",
  "That's what I heard, roughly.": "",
  "The, uh... The retrial for\nEmi's case is coming up.": "",
  "After that,\nEmi's case is going to be retried. ": "",
  "That'll be more\nof a formality than anything.": "",
  "It's more of a formality than anything.": "",
  "And don't worry...\nNobody believes you killed Emi-chan anymore.": "",
  "No one thinks you killed\nEmi-chan at this point.": "",
  "You're already taking off?": "",
  "Leaving already?": "",
  "Actually, uh...": "",
  "I brought someone today...": "",
  "I brought someone else\nwho wants to talk to you today.": "",
  "He's been wanting to talk to you.": "",
  "Fumiya-kun?": "",
  "Fumiya-kun...?": "",
  "You can take it from here.": "",
  "You can take it from here?": "",
  "You're welcome to stick around, y'know.": "",
  "You're welcome to stick around.": "",
  "Heh. Nah.": "",
  "Later.": "",
  "Thanks for this...": "",
  "Hey, thanks...": "",
  "So Shono and Kuroiwa are both dead, huh?": "",
  "Shono and Kuroiwa are dead. ": "",
  "And Ichinose and Morita are behind bars.": "",
  "Ichinose and Prosecutor Morita\ngot arrested.": "",
  "Thanks to Yagami's agency, yes.": "",
  "And it's all thanks to the\nYagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Things may be somewhat\nhectic from now on, though.": "",
  "But it's only going to\nget crazier now.": "",
  "The Health Ministry is in turmoil...\nAs is the ADDC.": "",
  "The Ministry of Health must be\nreally shaken up, and the ADDC...": "",
  "Yes.\nThe Center will likely be shut down.": "",
  "I imagine it'll shut down.": "",
  "In the end...\nI suppose things worked out for Kajihira.": "",
  "Maybe that's what Kajihira\nwanted all along.": "",
  "That's unacceptable.": "",
  "I can't accept that.": "",
  "Well, you're in luck, Saori-kun. Sounds like they're\ninvestigating his collusion with Minister Kazami.": "",
  "Actually, it sounds like they'll be\ninvestigating his collusion with Minister Kazami.": "",
  "The police are already on the case.": "",
  "The police are already on it.": "",
  "Everyone tries...\nBut you can't escape the law.": "",
  "\"Heaven's net is wide,\nbut its mesh is fine.\"": "",
  "I suppose all bad deeds will\ncome to light eventually.": "",
  "No one gets away with\nanything sneaky, right?": "",
  "Yeah, you got that right.": "",
  "Oho. Impressive.": "",
  "Oh, and speaking of...": "",
  "But do you know this one?": "",
  "Yes?": "",
  "I'm no senile, old fool.\nYour little fling is clear as day.": "",
  "Office romance is forbidden at this firm.": "",
  "I'll have none of that\nin my office, is that clear!?": "",
  "It distracts you when there's\nwork to be done!": "",
  "Oh! I, uhhh...": "",
  "Ohhhh... Heh heh...!": "",
  "I had no idea, sir!": "",
  "That's a new one!": "",
  "There's nothing to be afraid of.": "",
  "That's really all you've got?": "",
  "Heh. Well, you kids are all the same.\nNever listen to an old fart like me.": "",
  "Not that anyone heeds warnings\nfrom old farts like me.": "",
  "Though it's not like we're any better, huh.\nAlways ignoring our elders.": "",
  "Although I suppose we were\nthe same way in our youth.": "",
  "Old friend...": "",
  "Matsugane?": "",
  "Y'know, I really wouldn't mind you goin' back.": "",
  "Well, you know I wouldn't mind.": "",
  "I mean back to being an attorney again.": "",
  "You can go back to\nthe law if you want.": "",
  "It's not like we got work comin' in.\nMaybe I could find a job at another agency or somethin'.": "",
  "I'm sure I could find work out there.\nNot like we have any.": "",
  "What are you talking about?": "",
  "What was that now?": "",
  "I'm not gonna abandon\nour business like that, man.": "",
  "I'm not about to\nclose up shop anyway.": "",
  "But this is your chance\nto be an upstanding citizen again.": "",
  "Even with an open invitation\nback to being respectable?": "",
  "C'mon, man. You know how much of a gaping shithole\nthis city is. Only a dumbass'd be a detective here.": "",
  "What kinda dumbass would choose\na detective's life in this shithole city?": "",
  "Well, thank you very much.": "",
  "Real nice of you.": "",
  "Kaito-san's right though, you know.": "",
  "Kaito-san's right, don't you think? ": "",
  "I mean just think about it. People would line up\njust to have you represent them.": "",
  "People would be lining up\nfor you to represent them now.": "",
  "It shouldn't even be a question.": "",
  "Should this even be a question?": "",
  "You think so?": "",
  "You really think so?": "",
  "Of course I think so.": "",
  " \"You really think so?\" he says...": "",
  "Genda-sensei would love to have\nyou back at his office! And, um...": "",
  "Even Genda-sensei would\ntake you back in a heartbeat. And...": "",
  "I'm sure Matsugane-san\nwould agree with him.": "",
  "It's what Matsugane-san would want.": "",
  "I have to say...": "",
  "She's right, man.": "",
  "I agree.": "",
  "Everything's led up to this point. It's like your story's circling\nback around. There's this fancy French word...": "",
  "Things got a little crazy,\nbut I think you being a lawyer is God's...": "",
  "Uh... Starts with a D...": "",
  "Uh, what was it again?": "",
  "This is your...": "",
  "God's...": "",
  "Your denouement?": "",
  "His plan?": "",
  "That's it!": "",
  "That's the word!": "",
  "Would you two give it a rest?": "",
  "Gimme a break...": "",
  "I quit. I'm not a lawyer anymore.\nI'm a detective.": "",
  "I quit practicing law,\nand I'm a detective now.": "",
  "But funny enough if I hadn't left Genda's...\nI never would've proven Okubo-kun innocent.": "",
  "Besides, I was only able to prove\nOkubo-san's innocence as a detective.": "",
  "Well, yes.\nI suppose that's true.": "",
  "I suppose that's kind of true.　": "",
  "Pretty damn ironic. It's been three years now...\nSince I abandoned the truth and left my job as a lawyer.": "",
  "Ironic, isn't it? As a lawyer,\nI all but ran from the truth...": "",
  "But it turned out that decision... Led me\nstraight to the truth I tried to run away from.": "",
  "But as a detective,\nI'd never seen the truth so clearly.": "",
  "Guess it goes to show...\nYou never know where your choices'll take you.": "",
  "You never know where your\nchoices will take you in life.": "",
  "It's destiny!\nThat's what you guys were saying just now, right?": "",
  "All part of God's plan, was it?": "",
  "So... No matter what decisions you might make...\nWhat comes after matters most.": "",
  "But it's all about follow-through,\nno matter what choice you make.": "",
  "The real important take away from all this...\nIs to never give up.": "",
  "Not giving up on it\nis the most important part.": "",
  "I... guess.": "",
  "Well... I suppose.": "",
  "By the way...": "",
  "Hm? What is it?": "",
  "What now?": "",
  "I was just thinking about how I looked in that suit.\nI didn't really pull it off, did I? I knew it!": "",
  "I hadn't worn a suit in forever,\nand it wasn't really working, was it?": "",
  "That settles it.\nI'm never wearing a suit again, no way, no how.": "",
  "I'm pretty certain that\nI'm done with suits for good. Yep.": "",
  "Hey, y'know!\nNow that's another plus of staying a detective!": "",
  "And to my point,\ndetectives never have to wear suits.": "",
  "Seriously...?": "",
  "Oh grow up...": "",
  "Hello? Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Hello? Yagami Detective Agency. ": "",
  "Huh? Your cat ran away\nand it still hasn't come home?": "",
  "Huh?\nYour cat ran away from home?": "",
  "What do you think this is lady, a pet shop?": "",
  "We're not exactly a pet shop here...": "",
  "Oh yeah? We'll do it!\nAsk her some more about the cat.": "",
  "Hey, that's right up my alley!\nCat got a name and description?": "",
  "But Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Chako. And she's five?": "",
  "Chako, five-year old female?": "",
  "Just send us a picture, yeah?": "",
  "Send us pictures, okay?": "",
  "All right,\ntime to get some catnip at Don Quijote!": "",
  "Nice, I'll pick up some\ncatnip at Don Quijote!": "",
  "This is our first job in a while.": "",
  "We haven't had a job in a while...": "",
  "Now let's go find that lady's cat!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
